{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CggeGVN2eVXcMUTJyija9","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"A least-squares fit gives |Dq| ≈ 406 cm⁻¹ and B ≈ 700 cm⁻¹, with all three bands reproduced to within about 150 cm⁻¹. The fit was done numerically. It does not pin the parameters down exactly: the residual is largest (about 147 cm⁻¹) on the lowest band.\n\n**Assignment.** For tetrahedral d⁸ the ground state is ³T₁(F). The three bands are:\n- ν₁ = ³T₂(F) ← ³T₁(F), at 3 600 cm⁻¹\n- ν₂ = ³A₂(F) ← ³T₁(F), at 7 870 cm⁻¹\n- ν₃ = ³T₁(P) ← ³T₁(F), at 16 410 cm⁻¹\n\n**Model.** Tetrahedral d⁸ behaves like octahedral d², so I used the d² energy expressions with a positive Dq′ = |Dq_t|. The real tetrahedral Dq is negative in the usual sign convention.\n- Relative energies in this picture: ³T₂ = 2Dq′ and ³A₂ = 12Dq′.\n- The two ³T₁ states (F and P) mix through the matrix [[−6Dq′, −4B], [−4B, 15B + 6Dq′]].\n- The lower eigenvalue of that matrix is the ground-state energy E₀. Each band energy is measured from E₀.\n\n**Fit.** The simple estimate Dq′ = (ν₂ − ν₁)/10 ≈ 427 cm⁻¹ does not work. It gives a ground-state mixing that is inconsistent with B ≈ 727 cm⁻¹ from ν₃. So I fitted Dq′ and B to all three bands together. The result is Dq′ ≈ 406 cm⁻¹ and B ≈ 702 cm⁻¹. The residuals are +147, −60 and −5 cm⁻¹ for ν₁, ν₂ and ν₃.\n\n**Result.**\n- |Dq| ≈ 406 cm⁻¹, so Δt = 10Dq ≈ 4 060 cm⁻¹. This corresponds to Dq_oct ≈ 900 cm⁻¹ for the same ligand set.\n- B ≈ 700 cm⁻¹, about 67% of the free-ion value of roughly 1 040 cm⁻¹.\n- C is not determined. Only spin-allowed triplet bands were given, and they do not depend on C.\n\n{\"Dq\": 406, \"B\": 702, \"C\": null, \"out_of_scope\": false, \"reason\": \"Fit of the three triplet bands with the d8 Td (d2-analogue) T1(F)-T1(P) matrix; |Dq| used, C not determinable from spin-allowed bands.\"}"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":266,"cache_read_input_tokens":3539,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":266,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1379ac94-3de4-4ec7-8372-52056da6667d","uuid":"6697a53f-8c3c-40b4-89f2-50e28c46c495","timestamp":"2026-11-03T20:41:53.910Z","request_id":"req_011CggeGV2CcVUdMMXHnQ8n6"}
